@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #235573
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EAF4F8
title SaigonBite - Overall Order State Machine (Proposed)\nVõ Tấn Tài - 524H0126

[*] --> Pending : placeOrder / UC03 (proposed)
Pending --> Confirmed : confirmOrder / UC07\n[authorized Kitchen Staff]
Pending --> Rejected : rejectOrder / UC07\n[authorized Kitchen Staff and reason]
Pending --> Cancelled : cancelOrder / UC05\n[eligibility To Confirm]
Confirmed --> Preparing : startPreparation / UC08
Preparing --> Ready : markReady / UC08
Ready --> OutForDelivery : confirmPickup / UC10\n[assigned Shipper]
OutForDelivery --> Delivered : confirmDelivery / UC10\n[assigned Shipper and payment input valid]\n/ record COD if applicable
OutForDelivery --> Failed : reportFailure / UC10\n[assigned Shipper and reason]
Rejected --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
Delivered --> [*]
Failed --> [*]

note right of Pending
  UC03 specification is not yet in the repository.
  Creation in Pending follows the existing team flow.
end note
note right of Ready
  UC08 is outside this six-UC review but bridges
  UC07 confirmation and UC10 pickup.
end note
note bottom of OutForDelivery
  UC04 tracks Order without changing state.
  UC13 changes Hub data; UC16 reads report data.
  Exact state policy and cancellation eligibility
  remain To Confirm against the Case Study.
end note
@enduml
